sourceDesc.p:
Bodleian Library, MS Eng. Lett. c. 22. ALS; 4p..  Previously  published: Kenneth Curry (ed.), New Letters of Robert Southey, 2 vols (London and New York, 1965), I, pp. 66–69 [in part; verses not reproduced];
                  Charles Cuthbert Southey (ed.), Life and Correspondence of Robert Southey, 6 vols (London, 1849–1850), I,
                  p. 216 [in part; 1 paragraph, taken from 5 August section but misdated 1 August 1794].
